---
---

<section id="skills" class="reveal space-y-6 border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 pt-16">
  <div class="space-y-1">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">Core Expertise</h2>
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Keahlian & Toolkit Utama</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
    
    <!-- Card 1: Laravel Backend & Web Systems -->
    <div class="tech-card reveal delay-100 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">
        <span class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/40 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-lg">⚡</span>
        <span>Backend & Ekosistem Laravel</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Perancangan sistem informasi manajemen (SIMPUS, Healthcare, Inventory), arsitektur modular MVC/Repository, RESTful API, database relational MySQL/PostgreSQL, serta integrasi frontend Blade & Tailwind CSS.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 font-semibold">Laravel & Blade</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">PHP 8</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">MySQL / PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">RESTful API</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Composer</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: AI & Algorithmic Engineering -->
    <div class="tech-card reveal delay-200 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">
        <span class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-950/40 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 text-lg">🤖</span>
        <span>Applied AI & Algorithmic Engineering</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Penerapan model AI multimodal untuk ekstraksi visual nota/dokumen (Vision OCR), integrasi LLM API, implementasi algoritma graf & rute terpendek (Dijkstra), serta PWA offline-first.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300 font-semibold">Vision AI OCR</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Google Gemini API</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Dijkstra Shortest Path</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">PWA Offline-First</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Google OAuth 2.0</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Structured JSON Output</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
